	&lt;div class="alert-body"&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;We build a production-ready containerized RESTful API server application using Axum, Tokio, Tower, Toasty ORM, Garde, Utoipa with Docker and PostgreSQL.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Configurations</title><link>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/configurations/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/configurations/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Database and DB Migrations</title><link>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/database-and-db-migrations/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/database-and-db-migrations/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Generate OpenAPI Specification</title><link>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/generate-openapi-specification/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/generate-openapi-specification/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Initialize the Server</title><link>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/initialize-the-server/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-rust.github.io/labs/initialize-the-server/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="create-new-workspace"&gt;Create New Workspace&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run following commands to create the workspace.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mkdir rest_api_workspace &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; rest_api_workspace
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; -e &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;[workspace]\nresolver = \&amp;#34;3\&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt; ./Cargo.toml
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cargo new crates/book_service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mkdir crates/book_service/src/bin &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; mv crates/book_service/src/main.rs crates/book_service/src/bin/app.rs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then manually update &lt;code&gt;book_service/Cargo.toml&lt;/code&gt; to add &lt;code&gt;default-run&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;[[bin]]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These steps will generate the following folder structure,&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;div class="code-window highlight"&gt;
 
	&lt;div class="code-header"&gt;
		&lt;div class="traffic-lights"&gt;
			&lt;div class="light light-red"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
			&lt;div class="light light-yellow"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
			&lt;div class="light light-green"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;span class="code-title"&gt;Folder Structure&lt;/span&gt;
		&lt;div&gt;
			
		&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
 
	&lt;div class="code-body"&gt;
		&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell" &gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├── Cargo.toml
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;├── Cargo.lock
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;└── crates
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; └── book_service
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; ├── Cargo.toml
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; └── src
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; └── bin
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; └── app.rs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;




